[TITLE]
Audit fixture: two bulk species (first-order decay and a MASS source at R1) and a wall species, for the EPS audit's runs whose pumps, valves and tanks change under the species (MSX audit slice)
[OPTIONS]
AREA_UNITS M2
RATE_UNITS HR
SOLVER RK5
COUPLING NONE
TIMESTEP 300
RTOL 0.001
ATOL 0.0001
[SPECIES]
BULK CL2 MG
BULK TR MG
WALL BIO UG/M2
[COEFFICIENTS]
CONSTANT Kb 0.25
[PIPES]
RATE CL2 -Kb*CL2
RATE TR 0
RATE BIO 0.01*CL2 - 0.5*BIO
[TANKS]
RATE CL2 -Kb*CL2
RATE TR 0
[SOURCES]
MASS R1 TR 20
[QUALITY]
GLOBAL CL2 0.5
NODE R1 CL2 1.2
